 business with a $28.3B market cap on $7.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +31% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 14% against a 10% cost of capital, a 4-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage of 17\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield of 2.8% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and stock-based comp at 12% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 265% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":2.6475199804482648},{"text":"Operating margins 9% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Elevated short interest (11.1% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting the other way","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $18.2M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Can Coinbase Global (NASDAQ:COIN) Sustain Its Operating Momentum?","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/stocks/technical-analysis/can-coinbase-global-nasdaqcoin-sustain-its-operating-momentum","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795811220.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Coinbase Global (COIN) And The Long Term Crypto Bet Following Wirex Tokenized Stocks","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/nasdaq-coin/coinbase-global/news/coinbase-global-coin-and-the-long-term-crypto-bet-following","date":"2026-11-26","timestamp":1795727508.025,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.153,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Coinbase Global vs. Upstart: Which Financial Stock Is a Better Buy for 2027?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/coinbase-global-vs-upstart-financial-171835657.html","date":"2026-11-27","timestamp":1795799915.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.731,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Anthropic vs. Coinbase: One Stock Is Overhyped, One Is Oversold, Says Top Investor","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.ya